      "text": "DocIntel Parsing Test: Text and Tables\n\n  Synthetic sample data for testing PDF extraction. All names and values are fictional.\n\n 1. City service overview\n\n Northport expanded its library services between 2023 and 2025. The table below reports annual visits and active\n memberships. Visits are counted at the entrance; memberships count people with an active card at year end.\n\n Table 1. Northport library usage\n\n   Year               Library visits (thousands)                      Active members (thousands)\n\n   2023             412                                      68\n\n   2024             438                                      71\n\n   2025             465                                      75\n\n\n  Interpretation: visits increased from 412 thousand in 2023 to 465 thousand in 2025. The 2025 membership count was\n 75 thousand, not 465 thousand.\n\n  Note: figures are rounded to the nearest thousand. A visit is not a unique visitor.\n\n\n 2. Budget summary\n\n The budget categories below use Canadian dollars in millions. Capital spending is separate from operating spending;\n the total row is the sum of the two categories.\n\n Table 2. Northport library budget (CAD millions)\n\n   Category                                         2024                      2025\n\n   Operating                                                 8.4                            9.1\n\n    Capital                                                    1.2                            1.8\n\n    Total                                                      9.6                          10.9\n\n\n  Footnote: the 2025 capital amount includes a one-time building repair allocation of CAD 0.6 million.\n\n\n\n\n\nDocIntel test document - synthetic data                                                                         Page 1",
