      "text": "DocIntel Parsing Test: Continued\n\n 3. Program results\n\n The following table reports participation by program and location. Each row combines a program, a location, and its\n  participant count. Counts refer to 2025 only.\n\n Table 3. Program participation, 2025\n\n   Program                       Location                  Participants            Completion rate\n\n    Digital skills                       Central                 120                82%\n\n    Digital skills                     East                    85                 76%\n\n   Career workshops                 Central                 64                 91%\n\n   Career workshops                East                    48                 88%\n\n\n Example question: How many people joined Digital skills at the East location? The correct answer is 85. The 76%\n  figure in the same row is the completion rate, not the participant count.\n\n 4. Definitions and caveats\n\n Completion rate is the percentage of enrolled participants who attended the final session. It is calculated separately\n  for each program and location. The figures should not be added across percentage cells.\n\n  Source: Fictional Northport Service Office, DocIntel test dataset, prepared September 2026.\n\n\n\n\n\nDocIntel test document - synthetic data                                                                         Page 2",
